 :actor/purpose   "World PUBLIC-PATENT KG-mirror observatory — the all-technology generalization of tokigusuri 時薬 (the pharma patent-cliff subset). Ingests public patent bibliographic data (USPTO PatentsView CC0 / EPO OPS free / WIPO PATENTSCOPE) into the kotoba Datom log AND persists the corpus to the DataLad dataset substrate (80-data/hirameki-patents/, ADR-2605241500), content-addressed to CIDv1. Per technology FIELD it runs edge-primary exclusivity-CONCENTRATION (top-assignee share + named-HHI) vs a RELEASE-READINESS buffer (expired + expiring-soon + open-licensed) routed to RELEASE (解放) / open-license / de-monopolization / monitor; per PATENT it reads the RELEASE CLOCK (years-to-expiry). OBSERVATION ONLY — never files, never litigates, never trades; a release map, NEVER a patent-busting / FTO / infringement / patent-equity tool. Supersedes the legacy RisingWave/B2/BPMN patent pipeline (ADR-2604251024). Sibling of tokigusuri (pharma), tsumugi (power-KG), kabuto (supply-chain), busshi (commodities)."
 :actor/status    :r0
 :actor/adr       "2606212200"
 :actor/related   ["2604251024" "2606171300" "2604271830" "2605262130" "2605312345" "2605241500" "2606022000" "2606161730"]

 :actor/charter-rider
 {:rider/version "3.5"
  :rider/applied true}

 :actor/gates
 [{:gate/id "G1" :gate/name "release-map-not-verdict" :gate/rule "A RELEASE map (exclusivity→commons), NEVER a patent-busting / FTO-opinion / infringement-determination / per-company-verdict / patent-equity signal; :hirameki/infringement-verdict, :hirameki/fto-opinion, :hirameki/equity-signal unrepresentable (test-enforced)"}
  {:gate/id "G2" :gate/name "patent-is-object-never-holder" :gate/rule "A patent is the GATED OBJECT, never a 取-holder source — only an assignee/holder imposes exclusivity; :hirameki.patent/imposes-on unrepresentable (enforced in code + test)"}
  {:gate/id "G3" :gate/name "non-adjudicating-no-forecast" :gate/rule "Patent status (granted/expired) + assignee share are DISCLOSED facts from the issuing office, never re-judged (no validity/novelty verdict) and never a forecast"}
  {:gate/id "G4" :gate/name "lawful-release-only" :gate/rule "Release via statutory expiry / public-domain / voluntary open licensing (pledge / pool / FRAND-zero / MPP) only; circumvention / infringement / design-around-to-evade unrepresentable (:hirameki.patent/design-around)"}
  {:gate/id "G5" :gate/name "kotoba-eavt-native" :gate/rule "State is kotoba EAVT Datoms (no SQL/RisingWave/Cypher — supersedes ADR-2604251024); derived datoms flagged :hirameki/derived + :hirameki/sourcing"}
  {:gate/id "G6" :gate/name "aggregate-no-person-inventor" :gate/rule "Aggregate-first; assignee = org; NO person-level inventor targeting (:hirameki.inventor/person unrepresentable); no-doxxing (tsumugi/keizu lineage)"}
  {:gate/id "G7" :gate/name "murakumo-only" :gate/rule "Any narration via Murakumo no-VKE mesh only (DEFAULT-PREFERRED per Rider v3.3 §2(i) / ADR-2606172359)"}
  {:gate/id "G8" :gate/name "no-server-key" :gate/rule "Platform holds no key; live primary-source ingest + IPFS pin/IPNS publish are operator steps (R0 seed = :representative)"}
  {:gate/id "G9" :gate/name "datalad-content-addressed" :gate/rule "Corpus persisted to 80-data/hirameki-patents/ (DataLad + git-annex + IPFS, ADR-2605241500), each artifact CIDv1 (raw/sha2-256) byte-identical to `ipfs add --cid-version=1 --raw-leaves`; the loop never queries the API (snapshot = SoT)"}]

 :actor/non-goals
 [{:n/id "N1" :n/rule "NOT a patent-filing/prosecution/generation actor — 60-apps/etzhayyim-project-open-patent does invention generation; hirameki only observes/mirrors"}
  {:n/id "N2" :n/rule "NOT legal advice / FTO / patentability opinion (chigiri 契 UPL boundary)"}
  {:n/id "N3" :n/rule "NOT a patent-equity / litigation-prediction signal (G3); mitooshi owns distributions"}
  {:n/id "N4" :n/rule "NOT the pharma patent-cliff specialist — that is tokigusuri 時薬; hirameki is the all-technology generalization, pharmaceutical compounds deferred to tokigusuri"}
  {:n/id "N5" :n/rule "No person/individual inventor data (G6)"}]

 :actor/methods
 [{:method/id "hirameki_edn" :method/file "methods/hirameki_edn.cljc" :method/role "seed loader + classify (:field / :patent)"}
  {:method/id "analyze"      :method/file "methods/analyze.cljc"      :method/role "analyze (field concentration + patent release-clock) → datoms → render-datoms → coverage → render-report (+ bb CLI)"}
  {:method/id "cid"          :method/file "methods/cid.cljc"          :method/role "CIDv1 raw/sha2-256 content-address (ipfs-add parity), clj port of rasen/cid.py"}
  {:method/id "dataset"      :method/file "methods/dataset.cljc"      :method/role "G9: patent corpus → EDN → DataLad substrate (80-data/hirameki-patents/) + publish-manifest (+ bb CLI)"}
  {:method/id "ingest"       :method/file "methods/ingest.cljc"       :method/role "G8/G9 LIVE ingest (USPTO ODP): pure odp->patent normalizer (authoritative + cited source, G6 drops inventors) + env-key fetch → merge-corpus → re-materialize (+ bb CLI; no-server-key)"}
  {:method/id "kotoba"       :method/file "methods/kotoba.cljc"       :method/role "content-addressed append-only OBSERVATION LEDGER (tx-cid/append-tx/read-log/verify-chain)"}
  {:method/id "autorun"      :method/file "methods/autorun.cljc"      :method/role "deterministic idempotent-by-content heartbeat — analyze → append release-observation datoms on change (+ bb CLI)"}]

